#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:1251
msgid ""
"ZapFast keeps your unreadable archive as a separate file, creates a new one, "
"and asks you to link again. Linking again brings back recent history from "
"your phone. Afterwards, remove the old ZapFast entry under Linked devices on "
"your phone."
msgstr ""
"ZapFast 會將無法讀取的存檔另存為獨立檔案、建立新的存檔，並請您重新連結。重新"
"連結後，最近的記錄會從手機取回。之後，請在手機的「已連結的裝置」中移除舊的 "
"ZapFast 項目。"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:1255
msgid ""
"If you can restore the original keyring instead, choose Cancel and Try "
"again: nothing is lost that way."
msgstr ""
"如果您能改為還原原本的金鑰圈，請選擇「取消」，再選擇「Try again」：這樣不會遺"
"失任何內容。"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:1258
